# Components

- Prefer Server Components; add `"use client"` only for interactivity
- Use `cn()` for class merging
- Import shadcn primitives from `@/components/ui/`
- Do not modify `ui/` primitives for one-offs — compose wrappers
- Icons from lucide-react at `h-4 w-4` in nav
- Permission-aware UI: check `user.permissions.includes('key')` but always enforce server-side too
- List tables: use co-located `*-table.tsx` client wrappers for `DataTable`; see `.cursor/rules/datatable.mdc`
